ERRORS [status codes, causes, fixes]
deps=index.cuntext

400  bad-request         malformed JSON or missing required field
                         fix: check body schema in relevant fragment

401  unauthorized        missing or invalid X-API-Key header
                         fix: set header X-API-Key with valid key

403  forbidden           action requires owner role (workspace invite/delete)
                         fix: use the workspace owner's API key

404  not-found           session expired, checkpoint deleted, or workspace not accessible
                         session-fix: POST /session/create to make a new one
                         checkpoint-fix: GET /checkpoints and use a valid ID
                         workspace-fix: GET /workspaces to see what you have access to

423  locked              session is already executing code
                         fix: wait for current execution to finish, or use /execute/async

429  rate-limited        too many requests per minute
                         body: {error, limit:int, window:str, plan:str, upgrade:url}
                         fix: exponential backoff (1s, 2s, 4s, 8s)

429  credits-exhausted   daily credit limit reached (1 credit = 1 exec-second)
                         body: {error:"Daily credit limit reached", credits_used:int,
                                credits_limit:int, resets:"midnight UTC", upgrade:url}
                         fix: wait until midnight UTC, or upgrade at upgrade url

507  storage-quota       checkpoint storage full for your plan
                         body: {used_mb:float, limit_mb:float}
                         fix: DELETE /checkpoints/{old_id} to free space, or upgrade

500  internal            worker process crashed or unhandled error
                         body: {error:str} with Python traceback
                         fix: check your code for syntax/runtime errors

# Common recovery patterns
session-expired → POST /session/create, optionally restore from checkpoint
rate-limited    → exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s
quota-exceeded  → GET /checkpoints, DELETE old ones, retry
session-busy    → wait and retry, or use POST /session/{id}/execute/async
